hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2836","###
 Narrated to us Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abdul-Hakam, who said: Narrated to us Sa'id bin Bashir al-Qurashi, who said: Abdullah bin Hakim al-Kinani, from the people of Yemen and among their freed clients, narrated to me, saying: From Bishr bin Qudamah al-Dhibabi, who said: My own eyes witnessed my beloved, the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), standing at Arafat upon his red she-camel, Al-Qaswa', with a Qatwani blanket"
